00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:36,320
This is Mr. Gao Yuhai,

297
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,640
Chairman of Wending Group.

298
00:15:37,640 --> 00:15:39,840
He's here specifically to see Bai Jiuzhou.

299
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:40,360
Hello.

300
00:15:40,560 --> 00:15:41,440
Thank you.

301
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:45,400
Zhao...

302
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:48,400
Zhao Wenjuan.

303
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:51,120
Zhao Wenjuan.

304
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,440
A little token of our appreciation.

305
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:03,300
Please take it.

306
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:05,850
No need to be polite.

307
00:16:06,640 --> 00:16:07,370
Just take it.

308
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:11,320
Thank you.

309
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:17,140
You shouldn't be thanking us.

310
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:19,040
We are the ones who should

311
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,200
thank Jiuzhou.

312
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:23,280
If Jiuzhou hadn't testified for us,

313
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:25,320
Wending Group

314
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:27,800
would have really gone under this time.

315
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:30,920
Fengshu,

316
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:32,360
perfect timing.

317
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:33,120
Take

318
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:34,360
Zhao...

319
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:35,680
Wenjuan.

320
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:37,480
to the inpatient department

321
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,940
and pay a 100,000 deposit.

322
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:39,840
You'll need it

323
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:41,300
for the hospitalization.

324
00:16:43,520 --> 00:16:44,050
Let's go.

325
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:44,810
Come with me.

326
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:48,440
Go ahead.

327
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:50,890
I'm here for you.

328
00:16:51,640 --> 00:16:52,200
Let's go.

329
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,000
Bai Jiuzhou

330
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:27,200
has such a beautiful wife.

331
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:30,020
Why bother?

332
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:49,040
So stubborn.

333
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:50,880
Ill-fated.

